    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH1a0903-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:02:53.163+09:00">Tradition has it that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:06:41.819+09:00">Heaven generating all the kinds of things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:07:04.454+09:00">nurtures them through Earth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:09:47.682+09:00">and the Sages bring them to (civilised) completion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:12:01.007+09:00">The effective virtues (of these three) are then integrated</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:13:41.503+09:00">and thereby the Art of the Way arises.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:29:44.846+09:00">It (Heaven) lays out sun and moon </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:29:02.859+09:00">and arranges the constellations</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:30:13.817+09:00">it arranges the four seasons in their proper order</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:31:05.128+09:00">and it attunes Yin and Yang;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:34:27.071+09:00">it diffuses the vital energies and controls the basic nature of things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:36:43.669+09:00">and it establishes in their proper order the Five Cosmic Agents;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:37:07.821+09:00">in spring it engenders, in summer it makes things grow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:38:44.541+09:00">it autumn it has things harvested, in winter it has them stored;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:39:01.793+09:00">through Yang it creates thunder and lightning</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:39:41.957+09:00">through Yin it forms snow and frost;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:40:54.759+09:00">it rears and systains all the living creatures</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:41:49.639+09:00">in one case making them flourish, in another making them die;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:43:35.133+09:00">it wettens them through wind and rain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:50:36.196+09:00">dries them up them through sunlight</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0903_CHANT_001-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-26T00:54:51.096+09:00">it keeps them warm through seasonal climate</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
